      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 460,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## 37 · AI Task Automation\nTurns free-text requests (\"remind Priya to send the deck by Thursday\") into structured, prioritised tasks in your task tool.\n\n**Trigger:** `POST /webhook/task-automation` (JSON body)\n\n**Setup**\n1. Edit the **Config** node (model, sheet URL, endpoints).\n2. Connect credentials: OpenAI API, Slack.\n3. Pick Slack channels / sheet tabs on the action nodes.\n4. Activate.\n\n**Sample payload:**\n```json\n{\n \"request\": \"Remind Priya to send the investor deck by Thursday, it is urgent\",\n \"requested_by\": \"kiran\"\n}\n```"
      }
    }
